  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labgar Animal Fattening and Marketing Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Animal fattening.Beneficiaries: 56 (33 women).Description: The group seeks to expand its operation through construction of a shelter with water and fencing to increase the number of animals that can be fattened, and improve quality/price of animals; diversify to include cattle fattening in addition to sheep; increase in working capital to buy animals and feed; and training in breeding techniques to improve quality and prices of animals sold.</narrative>
  </description>
